 from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 36% of normal, and November to December ran 32%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 32% of normal. Grid 18798 had its driest year in 1986 at 65% of normal.</p>"}
